{"ts":"2026-08-31T19:04:54.766Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"2e37782ad60a9b8410683521","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"files_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T19:04:54.766Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":".github/workflows/ci.yml","scope":"project"},{"path":"justfile","scope":"project"},{"path":"src/history.rs","scope":"project"},{"path":"src/lib.rs","scope":"project"},{"path":"tests/branch_merge_contract.rs","scope":"project"},{"path":"tests/conformance_differential.rs","scope":"project"},{"path":"tests/support/published_cli.rs","scope":"project"}]}],"before_hash":"c3c74bc2b60b474e2d42c7d34f4dceedb40df1f6ac0db90aa9ac803c28cded61","after_hash":"40339b0996cb6ba4838ee7ecd402868083a50754c839dee18d5631a60d7ca633","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T19:04:56.557Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"2e37782ad60a9b8410683521","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T19:04:56.557Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-31T19:04:56.557Z","author":"claude","text":"A skip-on-missing-dependency test is a gate that fails by not running. conformance_differential printed a clear skip notice and returned Ok, which is correct for a developer without Node installed and wrong for CI, where the dependency is the point of the run. The fix is not to remove the skip but to make it conditional: PM_RUST_REQUIRE_PUBLISHED_CLI turns a missing CLI into a failure, CI sets it, and local runs keep the convenience. Verified in both directions, the guard fails loudly with the flag set and no CLI, and still skips cleanly without the flag."}]}],"before_hash":"40339b0996cb6ba4838ee7ecd402868083a50754c839dee18d5631a60d7ca633","after_hash":"9e2995e976c06084d43480434dc07837c39cc5ea35422bd7f62ac2a3ff2485e8","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T19:04:57.754Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"2e37782ad60a9b8410683521","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T19:04:57.754Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-31T19:04:57.754Z","author":"claude","text":"The epoch was the only divergence. Decoding both sides of the differential failure showed before_hash 3cc22dff72be and after_hash ba6c2311b115 identical on both, with item_hash_version 2 on the native side and 3 on the published side. That is why the fix is a constant rather than a rewrite of the hashing, and why every recorded fixture needed only its marker updated, which each fixture test then confirmed by passing unchanged otherwise."}]}],"before_hash":"9e2995e976c06084d43480434dc07837c39cc5ea35422bd7f62ac2a3ff2485e8","after_hash":"816ff10103816766af700976c4577c67e5f4eb56c8db589739387081a778d039","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
